r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TITRE<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt;1:80<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ratio<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=190 valign=top style='width:142.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&lt;1:80\r\n  NEGATIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:14.4pt'>\r\n  <td width=306 valign=top style='width:229.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>TPHA - INTERPRETATION<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NON REACTIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=190 valign=top style='width:142.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:14.4pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>NON\r\n  REACTIVE<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=306 valign=top style='width:229.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Methodology\r\n  : AGGLUTINATION<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=190 valign=top style='width:142.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n <tr style='height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <td width=306 valign=top style='width:229.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n  \"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=162 valign=top style='width:121.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=90 valign=top style='width:67.5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\n  style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n  <td width=190 valign=top style='width:142.55pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\r\n  height:12.7pt'>\r\n  <p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n  <\/td>\r\n <\/tr>\r\n<\/table>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>COMMENT\r\n<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:-72.0pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Syphilis detection tests are serologic\r\ntests used to screen for and confirm infection with T pallidum. These tests\r\nhave largely replaced direct visualization of spirochetes owing to greater ease\r\nof testing, less reliance on observer experience, and less-expensive equipment.\r\nThe tests are categorized into two serologies: nontreponemal tests and the\r\ntreponemal tests.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:-63.0pt'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>CLINICAL NOTES <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:-63.0pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Syphilis is a chronic infection\r\nthat progresses through distinct stages namely Primary, Secondary,Tertiary\r\n&amp; Quarternary producing diverse clinical symptoms. The infection is caused\r\nby the Spirochaete Treponema acquired usually by sexual contact although the\r\ndisease may be transmittedthrough blood transfusion and intra-uterine\r\ninfection. Positive results indicate both past or presentinfections.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-right:-63.0pt'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>False positive results are seen\r\nin patients suffering from Leprosy, Infectious mononucleosis and Connective\r\ntissue disorders. This test does not distinguish between Syphilis and other\r\npathogenic treponemal infections. All positive results should be confirmed with\r\nFTA-ABS (Fluorescent Treponemal Antibodies) test.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"612.0pt 792.0pt","margin":"148.5pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 31.5pt"}}